WEBVTT

00:00:02.900 --> 00:00:10.308
Without meditation, you don't understand
what is best for you.

00:00:11.060 --> 00:00:17.500
So today is a day when you have to promise
me that you will meditate every night,

00:00:17.500 --> 00:00:20.330
every evening, maybe in the morning also.

00:00:20.634 --> 00:00:24.668
Whenever it is possible, if you can go
into meditative mood

00:00:24.924 --> 00:00:30.302
you are in contact with
this divine power.

00:00:30.798 --> 00:00:33.876
Then whatever is good for you,

00:00:34.052 --> 00:00:37.755
whatever good for your society,
for your country,

00:00:37.899 --> 00:00:41.156
all is done by this divine power.

00:00:42.452 --> 00:00:45.871
You don't have to overpower
the divine power.

00:00:45.871 --> 00:00:49.273
You don't have to order.
You don't have to ask.

00:00:49.561 --> 00:00:56.289
Just if you meditate you are one with
this all-pervading power

00:00:56.353 --> 00:01:01.044
which is another great blessings to us.

00:01:02.912 --> 00:01:07.056
Unless and until your Sahasrara is open,

00:01:07.200 --> 00:01:13.404
all the blessings of the divine power
cannot come to you. Cannot.

00:01:13.676 --> 00:01:19.431
Maybe you might get some money,
you might get some jobs,

00:01:19.576 --> 00:01:23.243
you might get this and that.
But your own development is only

00:01:23.243 --> 00:01:27.279
possible when you meditate and
your Sahasrara is completely open

00:01:27.423 --> 00:01:30.175
and open to truth.

00:01:30.447 --> 00:01:38.128
Now the truth is that this
divine power is compassion, is love.

00:01:38.300 --> 00:01:39.935
This is the truth.

00:01:39.999 --> 00:01:42.980
They say God is love, God is truth.

00:01:42.980 --> 00:01:48.365
So the equation has to be made that
truth is love and love is truth.

00:01:48.509 --> 00:01:53.735
But it's not a truth that as you have for
your own children, you have for your family.

00:01:53.863 --> 00:01:58.314
Attached. Attached love is not truth.

00:01:58.410 --> 00:02:04.382
If you're attached to somebody, then you
never see the bad points of that person.

00:02:04.494 --> 00:02:09.092
If you are angry with somebody, then you can
never see the good points of that person.

00:02:10.052 --> 00:02:13.715
But it's a complete detached love.

00:02:13.987 --> 00:02:17.164
And that love is extremely powerful.

00:02:18.032 --> 00:02:23.612
Because whenever you project that love to
anyone, you'll be surprised,

00:02:23.708 --> 00:02:27.896
the problems of that person will be solved.
His personality will improve.

00:02:27.896 --> 00:02:30.682
Everything will work out in a very big way

00:02:30.792 --> 00:02:33.160
and his life will be changed.

00:02:33.272 --> 00:02:37.760
But if you are attached
to anything whatsoever,

00:02:38.672 --> 00:02:44.006
that attachment itself causes problems

00:02:44.150 --> 00:02:49.476
and doesn't allow Sahaj to grow.

00:02:49.836 --> 00:02:53.836
This attachment could be any kind.

00:02:53.836 --> 00:02:56.420
For example, you can be
attached to your country,

00:02:56.612 --> 00:02:59.914
attached to your society,
attached to your family.

00:03:00.106 --> 00:03:01.732
It can be of any kind.

00:03:01.732 --> 00:03:06.732
But when Sahasrara is opened,
you learn one thing — is detachment.

00:03:06.976 --> 00:03:12.596
It just happens that you get detached.
Though, I mean, you are not running away.

00:03:12.812 --> 00:03:18.428
As it is, in Sahaja Yoga we don't believe
in people who run away from society

00:03:18.428 --> 00:03:23.636
and go to Himalayas. All that I call
as escapism. That is not the point.

00:03:23.636 --> 00:03:26.732
What happens is that you are there.

00:03:27.032 --> 00:03:32.968
You see everyone. You watch everyone.
You know everyone.

00:03:33.080 --> 00:03:37.876
You are close to everyone.
But, you are a detached person.

00:03:38.052 --> 00:03:42.832
It's a state of mind that
you achieve when Sahasrara is opened.

00:03:43.052 --> 00:03:48.225
Then in that state, you are
dealing with people,

00:03:48.225 --> 00:03:52.796
you are dealing with problems,
you are dealing with situations,

00:03:52.796 --> 00:03:56.141
but, you are not involved in it.

00:03:56.436 --> 00:04:01.832
There is no involvement, and that
involvement which you had before

00:04:02.136 --> 00:04:09.676
can never give a complete insight —
what is happening, what is the truth is

00:04:10.236 --> 00:04:12.676
about any situation.
So this detachment helps.

00:04:12.676 --> 00:04:17.432
The greatest thing of the detachment
is that you are not affected.

00:04:18.812 --> 00:04:24.092
No use saying that, “Oh, you
are not affected, Mother,

00:04:24.092 --> 00:04:29.210
so how can you feel for another person?"

00:04:29.320 --> 00:04:33.572
"How can you have compassion
for another person?"

00:04:33.764 --> 00:04:40.980
Because if you feel for another person,
then only you can solve the problem.

00:04:41.252 --> 00:04:46.381
But this feeling that you have is
again a kind of an attachment.

00:04:46.573 --> 00:04:52.624
It is not a real feeling,
because it doesn’t help.

00:04:53.132 --> 00:04:55.849
The person is crying; you are also crying.

00:04:55.961 --> 00:04:58.668
The person is troubled;
you are also in trouble.

00:04:58.668 --> 00:05:03.918
And this does not help that person,
nor will it help you.

00:05:04.188 --> 00:05:12.228
So to have detached in no way means
you do not feel the another person.

00:05:12.492 --> 00:05:19.492
You do feel. You feel the agony of
that person, the trouble of that person,

00:05:19.652 --> 00:05:24.724
of the whole society sometimes,
and of the whole country.

00:05:24.724 --> 00:05:29.693
But that you are feeling
is so detached that

00:05:30.013 --> 00:05:33.272
the all-pervading power takes over.

00:05:33.480 --> 00:05:39.924
First, we must have full faith in
the capability of this all-pervading power.

00:05:39.924 --> 00:05:46.200
As soon as you are detached, you say,
“You do it." Finished.

00:05:46.200 --> 00:05:50.916
Once you say that, “You are going to do it.
It’s you who is going to do it”,

00:05:50.916 --> 00:05:56.884
whole thing changes completely, because
you transfer all your responsibilities,

00:05:57.012 --> 00:06:00.271
all your problems, to this divine power,

00:06:00.351 --> 00:06:06.360
which is so powerful, which is so capable,
which can work out anything.

00:06:06.632 --> 00:06:12.004
So, whenever you think that this problem
you are going to solve, you are the one

00:06:12.084 --> 00:06:19.924
who is going to do it, then all right. The
divine power says, “All right, try your

00:06:20.132 --> 00:06:26.024
luck.” But if you can really put this problem
to the divine power, it will work out.